  path="/guides/protein-calories/"
  category="Guides"
  categoryPath="/guides/"
  lead="Understanding protein calories is the ultimate cheat code for sustainable fat loss. One gram of protein equals exactly 4 calories—but how your body processes those calories makes all the difference."
